\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d9/c0h2440w4dvqzhoswqe8xfgoa7eznb4.png/120px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7_%E9%87%91%E5%AD%94%E9%9B%80%E4%B9%8B%E8%88%9E.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/d/d9/c0h2440w4dvqzhoswqe8xfgoa7eznb4.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />金孔雀之舞\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:60%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>攻击提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">6%</font>。每拥有1层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"解放\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">解放</font></span></span>]，治疗效果、魔防提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">3%</font>。<br />对友军释放技能时，使其获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"解放\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">解放</font></span></span>]；目标若是自身，则获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>层，每个目标每回合最多生效1次。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><b>该个性属于</b><br /><br /><div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:90px;height:90px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%9F%83%E6%8B%89%E6%9B%BC%E6%B2%99%E6%BC%A0%E8%88%9E%E5%A8%98\" title=\"角色图鉴库/埃拉曼沙漠舞娘\"><img alt=\"头像 埃拉曼沙漠舞娘.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/b/b8/306utqq7rlfkvdx769xz